message: "If you use this research, please cite this archived version."
title: "Incidence-spectrum obstructions for length-maximal codes"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An incidence-spectrum argument proves the strengthened divisibility condition in Alderson's Problem 3 for length-maximal codes with Singleton defect at most q-2, including nonlinear codes over arbitrary q-symbol alphabets. A second argument settles the dimension-four, defect q-1 subfamily of Problem 5."
